                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "**THIS IS NOT A VR GAME**\nI bought this game from steam a while back and had to have it refunded due to the fact that VR support was removed and the game no longer plays in VR. The game itself is a remake of early 90s game 'shufflepuck cafe' which was on the Amiga and Atari ST computers. Its quite a good game to be fair but is a bit of a grind to progress in. Its pretty sad that its still being sold as playable in VR when it isn't. Surely the VR tag and marketing should have been removed by now.",
